Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.60,Hook,,0,0,0,,My grandma's 3 Halloween rules
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:01.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,MY GRANDMOTHER HAD THREE
