Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:07.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,RULE ONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:09.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,EVERY COSTUME IS HOMEMADE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,MINE WERE TERRIBLE.
